    Bug 1958478 - Rebuild the OpenPGP key import info dialog. r=kaie,arschmitz,tobyp

    Rebuilt the openpgpg info dialog to be pure HTML.
    Simplified the HTML and CSS of the section.
    Removed the need of size calculation, allowing natural scroll and text overflow.
    The font now resizes and follows the global font size.
    Created dialog specific files to avoid importing unnecessary large files.
    Added a fluent migration to prevent unneded translations.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311451

